# Maintain the system

Change the documented contract and the implementation together, so that the guidance never describes something the theme does not do.

For example, if a maintainer adds a semantic token for a warning colour, update the canonical palette data, regenerate the YAML themes and change the documentation page in one change. A hand-edit to one theme file leaves the other themes and the guidance out of step.


